# Migration checksums (scripts/db/migrate.js) are computed over the raw file
# bytes. Force LF regardless of the checking-out OS so the checksum recorded
# in app.schema_migrations at apply time never drifts from what a later
# checkout produces (see 20260804000000_crm_and_integrations.sql's
# migration_checksum_mismatch on Windows checkouts for why this matters).
supabase/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
